  "conformsTo": "http://mlcommons.org/croissant/1.1",
  "name": "YuLan-Mini-Text-Datasets",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tNews\n\t\n\n\n[2025.04.11] Add dataset mixture: link.\n[2025.03.30] Text datasets upload finished.\n\n\nThis is text dataset.\n\u8fd9\u662f\u6587\u672c\u683c\u5f0f\u7684\u6570\u636e\u96c6\u3002\nSince we have used BPE-Dropout, in order to ensure accuracy, you can find the tokenized dataset here.\n\u7531\u4e8e\u6211\u4eec\u4f7f\u7528\u4e86BPE-Dropout\uff0c\u4e3a\u4e86\u4fdd\u8bc1\u51c6\u786e\u6027\uff0c\u4f60\u53ef\u4ee5\u5728\u8fd9\u91cc\u627e\u5230\u5206\u8bcd\u540e\u7684\u6570\u636e\u3002\nFor more information, please refer to our datasets details and preprocess details.\n\n\n\t\t\n\t\tContributing\n\t\n\nWe welcome any form of contribution, including feedback on model bad cases, feature suggestions, and example\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/yulan-team/YuLan-Mini-Text-Datasets.",
  "alternateName": [
    "yulan-team/YuLan-Mini-Text-Datasets",
    "yulan_mini_text_datasets"
  ],
  "creator": {
    "@type": "Organization",
    "name": "RUC-GSAI-YuLan",
